{
  "note": "Hand-edited. The landing page's stage, claims, contrast pairs and banned words. tools/landing.py build writes them into index.html; tools/landing.py check refuses a page that says more than this file, and this file saying more than the backlog, the threat model or the spec.",
  "stages": [
    {
      "id": "pre-alpha",
